      "type": "text",
      "text": "Check liver function tests before starting oral terbinafine (hepatotoxicity may occur with or without liver disease). Periodic LFT monitoring is recommended; stop if liver injury develops."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
