       }
      ],
      "text": "Terbinafine inhibits CYP2D6:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " with TCAs, SSRIs, beta-blockers, class 1C antiarrhythmics or MAO-B inhibitors, monitor carefully; the 2D6 drug may need a lower dose."
     }
